      "writtenOn": "2017-08-17T19:59:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just add hooks for every syscalls.. we can pick out only the syscalls have actual security concerns to submit to upstream I guess",
      "parentUuid": "1626d77e_344f7a79",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1332,
